window.products.push({"id":837024,"name":"AMERINDIAN Pack of 3 Wooden Black Coffin Incense Stick Cone Burner Holder Stand with Storage Compartment Ash Catcher","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61a6kXRXgIL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The incense Box burner is perfect for your incense sticks or incense cones and protects your furniture when burning incense. It's very easy to use by simply raising the top lid and placing your incense inside. After lighting your incense gently close the lid and enjoy the relaxing aromas of your favourite incense as it drifts gently around your room. Beautifully carved handmade by the skilled local artisans and underprivileged women of India. Hand Crafted with Brass & Mango Wood. Inside are two metal dishes suitable for burning incense cones and two carved holes for incense sticks at either end of the base. There is a storage area for storing extra incense sticks at the bottom of the Box and accessed by a hinge on the right hand side. Use incense for meditation: Burning incense during meditation can not only help relax your mind, but it can also help give you a sense of focus. Use incense as an air freshener: Because incense produces a lot of fragrant smoke, it is possible to use this as an air freshener. Keep in mind, however, that incense will only mask odors, and that to eliminate a bad smell completely, you will have to get rid of the source (be it the trash, dirty dishes, dirty litter, and so forth). Use incense for aromatherapy: You can use incense to help you focus, increase motivation, ease headaches, and reduce depression. Burning incense may also help you relax and feel less stressed. Please Note: This Product has been meticulously hand-crafted by artisans in India, one piece at a time. As each piece is unique you may notice slight variation. These characteristics make this piece truly one-of-a-kind. As a natural result of the manufacturing process, products can feature small irregularities and cracks. Colours can differ from the actual product as digital scanner and screens may not replicate the original colour accurately.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61a6kXRXgIL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AMERINDIAN","source_asin":"B07X3VZ8CM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-837024","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07X3VZ8CM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07X3VZ8CM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":837025,"name":"CHF & You Alesandra Floral Embroidered Faux Silk Window Curtain Panel, Ivory, 44-Inch X 63-Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91wu1DeVYmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Exotic Eastern embroidery meets sophisticated Western styling in this exquisite Alesandra tailored window panel. The panel is constructed of a solid textured fabric with a hint of shimmer, shown here in a fashion-forward ivory hue. A large vine and floral embroidered motif accents the lower left and upper right corners of the panel. The single rod pocket panel measures 44 inches wide by 63 inches long, the perfect size for covering a standard window; purchase extra panels to cover wider windows or add fullness. The panel features a wide, three-inch rod pocket to accommodate today's decorative drapery hardware and is constructed of an easy-care, 100% polyester fabric; the panel is machine washable.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91wu1DeVYmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CHF & You","source_asin":"B01MXOTKVH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-837025","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MXOTKVH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MXOTKVH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
