window.products.push({"id":837131,"name":"Jabtraxx Wooden Muddler for Cocktails, 11.02″ Durable Ice Crusher & Muddler Mallet, Crushed Ice Mallet and Ice Crushers for Home & Bar Use","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41k415lH1ML._AC_.jpg","description":"[2-in-1 ICE CRUSHER] 1Pcs * Cocktail Muddler, 2Pcs * ice bag (size: about 30X40cm). Jabtraxx ice crushers for home use combines the best features of professional Mojito blenders and ice mallets into a stylish bar tool that can meet all your crushed ice and cocktail mix and match needs! [HIGH-QUALITY CHINESE WOOD] The durable muddler bar tool is made of high-quality beech wood from China. The surface is smooth, harmless and odorless, providing you with better performance, strength，which will not crack! Not suitable for dishwashers! It is recommended to clean it with a damp cloth with water, and place it in a dry place. [COMFORTABLE & EXQUISIVE DESGIGN] Stylish cocktail muddler has a round handle design, allowing you to hold it easily and safely. The perfect size (13.75\") & unique shape of the handy mojito muddler can minimize the impact on your wrist and require less impact while also helping you crush ice cubes or mash herbs, vegetables and fruits. And The exquisite cocktail muddler can also add a quaint atmosphere to your kitchen or bar counter. [COCKTAIL ICE BAG WITH DRAWSTRING DESIGN] After putting the ice cubes directly into the ice bag, use our Cocktail Muddler to break the ice cubes. The cocktail ice bag can absorb excess water when breaking the ice, and can retain the wine's flavor to the greatest extent. [EXCELLENCT GIFT] Crushed ice mallet is a natural quality, suitable for bars, restaurants, pubs, hotels and homes. It is a multi-functional bar and kitchen tool for everyone who likes bar accessories or wooden kitchen utensils. So you can give this perfect gift to your fiiend or family on single nights, weddings, housewarming, retirement, birthdays and Christmas!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41k415lH1ML._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Jabtraxx","source_asin":"B08T77B37F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-837131","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08T77B37F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08T77B37F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
