window.products.push({"id":837136,"name":"Dual Zone Wine Cooler Thermoelectric Refrigeartor Chiller Fridge Upper Zone 44f-54f Lower Zone 54f~65f with Upright Rack for Red White Wine Champagne ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mzFSEl9CL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❄KEEP DIFFERENT KINDS OF WINE IN BEST STORAGE TEMPERATURE: Maisee dual zone wine cooler is designed with a moderate and adjustable temperature range 44-65°F(7-18℃) within a consistent humidity, The temperature of the upper zone is 44-54°F(7-12℃), where you can store Sparkling/champagne, Semi-Sweet Wine, Semi-dry Wine, Dry White Wine etc. the lower is 54-65°F(12-18℃), where you can store Sweet Wine, Brandy, Semi-dry Red Wine , Dry Red Wine etc ❄VERTICAL AND HORZIONAL RACKS AVAILABLE FOR FLEXIBLE STORAGE: The small wine chiller features the upright rack for an opened and recorked bottle.Besides, these racks are removable to customize the storage space for larger bottles. The Dimension of the wine chiller are 13.6”(W)x19.3”(D)x32.1”(H) gives you a compact and modern design perfect for your living room, home office, or kitchen. It has a freestanding design for floor, table or countertop placement. ❄QUIET AND LOW VIBRATION: The wine cellar use thermoelectric cooling technology which is quiet and without vibration. So it does not affect family rest even if placed in the bedroom Maisee wine cooler is ETL certified, meaning it would use 25% less energy than the more conventional wine coolers. ❄UV-RESISTANT DOUBLE-PANED THERMOPANE GLASS: 18 bottles capacity wine chiller have double-paned glass can not only keep your collection away from the outer environment but also help avoiding the harmful light which will damage the tannin and overall flavor of your wine.Besides , the interior light won't give off wine-destorying UV that the sun does either. ❄QUALITY ASSURANCE: All of maisee wine coolers produced by certified materials and conforms to CL certified. We provide 1- year warranty. If you are not satisified with our wine cooler Refrigeartor , please feel free to contact with us and we won't let you suffer any loss","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mzFSEl9CL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"maisee","source_asin":"B08K2S9TPK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-837136","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08K2S9TPK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08K2S9TPK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":837137,"name":"ASSORTED WITH HAT","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.44,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51k3iy4veCL._AC_.jpg","description":"Become your own chocolatier with CybrTrayd’s complete line of confectionary making supplies! We offer a variety of food-grade PETG plastic molds that are durable and can be reused for a multitude of projects. Create chocolates for all occasions using our traditional shapes for cookie and cake molds or invest in more elaborate 3-D designs. Each mold is sealed in a poly bag with CybrTrayd instructions imprinted on it. This will provide details on chocolate melting and molding for all our molds, including the hollow 3-D molds. In addition, we’ve provided some tips and tricks for getting the best possible results. All of our plastic designs can also be used for soap making. Additional directions are provided soap melt & pour techniques.To prevent any damage to your mold please wash by hand and do not put it in the dishwasher. These plastic molds are not meant to be used with hard candy. The molds are not suitable for children under 3 and should only be used by older children with adult supervision.Chocolates make great favors or treats for parties and other special occasions. Use the hearts, strawberries, rose and other flowers for romantic gestures such as wedding favors or a Valentine’s Day surprise. Trees, ornaments, candy canes and other festive references are perfect for the holiday season. All of our adorable baby molds are ideal for showers and gender reveal parties. You can also add pop sticks to some of the chocolates and create lollipop celebrations.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51k3iy4veCL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CybrTrayd","source_asin":"B000EJM30M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-837137","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000EJM30M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000EJM30M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
