window.products.push({"id":837236,"name":"Vintage Rustic Sign - Authentic Barnwood Wall Decor for Perfect for Any Home, Apartment or Space - Mounting Hardware Included (19\" x 16\" x ½, Barnwood","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81eQjyxDV7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Home should tell the story of who you are, and be a collection of what you love! This wall mounted decor piece is made with strong and beautiful authentic rustic barn wood. Despite its rustic design, the elegant wood sign is extremely resilient and durable so it will last generations. So install this stylish sign in your entryway, bedroom, kitchen or mudroom and add a vintage touch to your house! Why Choose This Rustic Barn Wood Home Decor Sign? The wood pieces of the living room sign began their life by enduring many decades of growth in forests and then spent nearly a 100 years of its life protecting hay, cows, horses, equipment and the American farm family as exterior siding of a post and beam barn. As these once fine structures become neglected and forgotten our craftsman carefully remove their walls one board at a time. Now their life continues as a reminder of the past in your home as a repurposed wall decor, ready to remind you of what you hold dearest.. Get Your Very Own Unique Rustic Wall Decor Sign Today! Don’t hold back another minute! Get this stunning barn wood wall sign and decorate an empty wall and an entire room! Please note that the wood of this sign rack varies slightly in texture and color but not size! In fact, the size of our vintage wood sign is 19” x 16” x ½\" . This is an investment you won’t regret, so place an order today and make this beautiful wall mount sign yours!! Scroll Up And Click “Add to Cart” NOW!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81eQjyxDV7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rustic Jane","source_asin":"B07FF9YQGZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-837236","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07FF9YQGZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07FF9YQGZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
