window.products.push({"id":837279,"name":"Class of 2021 Table Runner, 2021 Graduation Table Decoration，Graduation Table Runner,Graduation Table Cloths，Graduation Tablecloth, Graduation Party D","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EC-0dGD6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Design style: table runner 71 inches × 12 inches Suitable for dining tables that can accommodate 2 to 6 people, and suitable for dining tables, coffee tables, entrance tables, outdoor terrace tables, coffee tables, etc. If you want to host the perfect graduation party or date, our table runner is a must-have choice. If you are looking for graduation decorations, then our cute table runner is perfect for you! This unique table runner will make your party more noble. Use them to decorate your graduation table and add more atmosphere to graduation. It is made of high-grade Oxford cloth fabric and can be reused. This is a good choice. You must use it for decoration after graduation Quality assurance, buy with confidence","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EC-0dGD6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"party lucky","source_asin":"B08Y5ZDPQY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-837279","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08Y5ZDPQY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08Y5ZDPQY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":837280,"name":"Rosin Tech 50 Micron Screen 4\" X 6\" 12pk Stainless Steel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91wo7dOPiUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Simply fold and crease the screen about your product to be pressed, slip it within some parchment paper, and your good to go. Screen unfolds and opens, unlike sewn bags, to be easily and quickly, emptied, rinsed and re-used. UPDATE: I noticed a short while ago, as did a few of my customers, that steel screen absorbs and wicks up heated resins Lets imagine for a moment that your unpressed source material is a wax soaked sponge. Rosin tech works due to heat and pressure. The heat makes the wax mobile and the pressure squeezes it out of the sponge. When using parchment paper as your collection media, heat makes the resin mobile and pressure squeezes it out of your source material. Being that parchment paper is neutral and non-stick, it has no affinity for resin or anything else. So when you release the pressure some resin gets absorbed back into the source material and thankfully some stays on the paper, hence the need for multiple pressings, depending on source characteristics. What if we use the steel screen as an additional collection media? Using screen within parchment, the resin has a place to move to when heated. It gets wicked away from the source material, and not reabsorbed upon pressure release. Both parchment paper and resin soaked steel screens require some work to collect the oils after pressing. Parchment is labor intensive as we all know, but all the steel screens would require is a quick wash in high proof grain alcohol or 99% isopropyl. After a short swirl, they come out crystal clear, looking brand new, and ready to be used again. The alcohol now gets strained thru one of the screens and is left to evaporate. Initial comparisons of the two collection methods seem to suggest steel screen yields 10% to 15% more resin from equal amounts of source material. Stay tuned for updates and please share your findings!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91wo7dOPiUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rosin Tech Products","source_asin":"B018N3JQ4Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-837280","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B018N3JQ4Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B018N3JQ4Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":837281,"name":"LIFE MAGIC Dining Chair Covers 2 Pack Parsons Chair Cover Kitchen Chair Slipcover Washable Removable for Kitchen, Hotel, Restaurant (Khaki)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OSslFba5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"CHAIR SLIPCOVERS - Stretch chair covers, using 85% polyester and 15% spandex fabric, stretchable and very snug, perfect for blocking daily stains, refurbishing old chairs, and home decor. The minimalist style can match different decorations to add more color to your home. SUITABLE SIZE - Suitable for seat back height 20'' -22.5'', seat back width 16'' -21.5'', seat back thickness 4.5'' or less. Chair seat width 17.5'' -20'', length 17.5'' -20.5'', thickness 5'' or less.Please measure your chair size before purchasing. EASY TO INSTALL - The chair covers can be installed in simple steps. The overall design allows you to slide the body onto the back of the chair and attach the bottom elastic band to the chair's seat. Also very easy to disassemble and wash and easy to take care of. MULTIPLE USES - Universal chair covers, suitable for most armless chairs and can be used for large size Parsons chairs. It also covers the backrest and cushion of the chair. In addition to operating at home, the decoration can also be used in restaurants, offices, hotels, and other places. HIGH QUALITY - Very soft chair covers for a comfortable sitting experience. Machine washable and removable, the bottom elastic band can make the chair cover fixed without sliding and fits your chair very well. Use skin-friendly wrinkle-resistant non-pilling fabric; no need to iron and bleach.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OSslFba5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LIFE MAGIC","source_asin":"B0B7G1PPNF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-837281","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B7G1PPNF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B7G1PPNF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
