window.products.push({"id":837377,"name":"Kids Rule 3-Piece Shark Sketch Sheet Set | 1 Twin Flat Sheet, 1 Twin Fitted Sheet & 1 Queen Pillowcase | 100% Softly Brushed Microfiber Polyester | So","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ywwhtmQOL._AC_.jpg","description":"ALL-INCLUSIVE SET: Dive into a sea of adventure with the Blue Shark Sheet Set. This captivating set features a twin flat sheet, a twin fitted sheet, and a queen pillowcase, all adorned with playful shark motifs. Made from high-grade materials, these sheets offer exceptional softness and comfort. The cool blue color scheme adds a refreshing touch to any bedroom decor. Make bedtime an exciting underwater expedition with this super cool shark-themed bed set. A GREAT FIT: This captivating set includes a twin flat sheet measuring 66\" X 96\", a twin fitted sheet measuring 39\" X 75\" X 12\", and one pillowcase measuring 20\" X 30\". Immerse your little ones in comfort as they sleep on these soft and cozy sheets. The playful blue shark design brings an element of excitement to their bedroom, igniting the imagination of little ones. Let the friendly sharks accompany them on a journey to dreamland where comfort and fun come together. PREMIUM QUALITY & EASY TO CLEAN: The twin-size shark beddings are made of 100% softly brushed microfiber polyester, making them lightweight, strong, and resistant to shrinking, stretching, and wrinkling. Quick-drying, these sheets provide a cozy sleep environment. With easy care instructions, they can be machine washed and dried on a gentle cycle, ensuring convenience and longevity. Make bedtime sharky with this durable and low-maintenance sheet set. DIVE INTO DREAMS IN A SHARK-FILLED BLUE: Experience a cool and cozy way to drift off to sleep with the Blue Shark bed set. This delightful set includes a twin flat sheet, a twin fitted sheet, and one pillowcase, all adorned with a playful shark design. The cool blue wave patterns set a relaxing mood, while the shark motif adds a touch of adventure to your bedroom. Made with comfort in mind, these sheets create a cozy haven for a restful night's sleep. SURPRISE AND DELIGHT WITH A GIFT THAT THRILLS: Unleash the excitement with the Kids Rule 3-Piece Shark Sketch Sheet Set, the ultimate gift for boys who love sharks. This set is adorned with captivating blue wavy patterns and sharks design. Ignite their imagination and create a bedroom filled with adventure. Give the gift of shark-infused dreams and endless excitement with the Kids Rule 3-Piece Shark Sketch Sheet Set.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ywwhtmQOL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kids Rule","source_asin":"B0BCP2ZSPD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-837377","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BCP2ZSPD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BCP2ZSPD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
