window.products.push({"id":837708,"name":"CHUGGER PUMP XCPSS-IN-1 X-DRY with Run Dry Protection, SS 115 Volt Inline Home Brewing System Beer Pump, 55\" Cord w/Plug, 1/2\" MPT Connections, ETL-Ce","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61E8zLZnR7L._AC_SL1350_.jpg","description":"New CHUGGER PUMP XCPSS-IN-1 X-Dry with Run Dry Protection is the first pump made by brewers for home brewers like you. Same pump as the CPSS-IN-1 but with Run Dry Carbon Bearing Material. ETL-certified and made with food compliant materials, it’s a premium, sensible, and affordable alternative to expensive March pumps and has 25 percent more power with its 1/20 HP motor. Another benefit is stainless-steel heads that are interchangeable with existing March brand pump motors. This pump is not a self-priming pump - the CHUGGER PUMP head must be flooded with liquid prior to turning on the pump. It has been tested for safety and performance standards. Please check your electrical requirements before placing order. Must be wired by an electrician.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61E8zLZnR7L._AC_SL1350_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Chugger Pumps","source_asin":"B07GX34LF5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-837708","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GX34LF5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GX34LF5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":837709,"name":"Copper Funeral Urn by Liliane Memorials - Cremation Urn for Human Ashes - Hand Made in Brass - Suitable for Cemetery Burial or Niche - Large Size fits","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/911NMivYNJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Liliane Memorials Brass Cremation Urns Vines Urn with Enbossed Copper Finish Funeral urn is handcrafted of 100% brass and finished in copper. The complex artisanal work includes an embossed and engraved design. Time-honored design offers an elegant resting place for your loved one. Attractive urn will fit well with any decor, particularly on a mantel over a fireplace or in a library. The Copper Vines Urn evokes the memory of your loved one in a traditional and timeless design. About Liliane's Memorial Urns Our handcrafting process results in slight variations in color or finish, making each urn a unique work of art. Our urns offer a threaded lid that allows you to safely and securely handle or transport the urn. A felt-lined bottom is standard on all of our urns to protect your fine furniture. Liliane's urns are maintenance free; simply wipe the hand-made brass urn with a clean dry cloth. All of our urns are wrapped in an plush cotton bag and securely packed in a box. Medium size urn fits remains of a person of up to 130 lbs. They are used to preserve small portion of ashes after spreading most of them, or to share the remains of a loved one among several relatives. 100% Satisfaction Guarantee We trust that you will be happy with the quality and design of our products If you are not happy with the design you selected, please return your unused urn to Amazon for a full credit and select another Liliane Memorial Urn. Unfortunately, given the personal nature of funeral urns we cannot accept returns after you have used the urn.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/911NMivYNJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Liliane Memorials","source_asin":"B00OEJZ7I8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-837709","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00OEJZ7I8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00OEJZ7I8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":837710,"name":"Lengthened Oversized Blanket Hoodie Wearable Blanket Sweatshirt for Women Men Kids - Navy Blue Hoodie Blanket Hooded Blanket with Sleeves and Giant Po","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":37.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sAxtolnDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100% Super Soft Flannel LENGHTHENED BLANKET HOODIE - This is a true one-size-fits-all blanket hoodie. It's super thick & warm & soft & long. Better than others, we extended the length of the blanket sweatshirt to 4’. Because it is longer, you can curl up in your recliner and cover most of your body with the wearable blanket. This truly improved 5XL hoodie blanket is suitable for the adult who is generally 5'5''-6'4'' tall for maximum comfort. SUPER SOFT & COMFORTABLE MATERIAL - Our luxuriously soft wearable blanket is made with 370 high GSM fluffy and thick flannel on both sides. It is thick, plush and warm and it feels truly amazing on. Soft and velvety outside, soft and fluffy inside. You could wear it all the time, the only problem is that you wouldn't want to pull it off! 2022 UPGRADE VERSION - 2022 upgraded version is made of 100% recycled material certified by the Global Recycled Standard (GRS), which means that our hooded blankets are environmentally friendly and non-toxic from the original materials and the earliest stages of production. PERFECT FOR ALL OCCASIONS - This blanket hoodie is wearable and perfect to slip on immediately on arising to move around in a cold house. It is very soft and the big hoodie keeps your head warm as well. It also can fit your switch and snacks in the large pocket. Everyone will like to nest in this warm blanket for whether indoor activities or outdoor sports events. Especially camping parties and garden walks, it's like wearing a hug. YOUR BEST GIFT - Our hoodie blanket would be an awesome gift for everyone who is always cold even when it's warm out. This hooded blanket is a must have for anyone who wants to be super comfortable! It is the perfect gift for birthday, Mother’s Day and Father’s Day!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sAxtolnDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Barfelty","source_asin":"B097YH6DTL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-837710","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097YH6DTL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B097YH6DTL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
