window.products.push({"id":837907,"name":"Lola Bella Gifts and Burton and Burton Cardinal Snow Frosted Round Ornament with Red Feathered Soul Poem and Box Sympathy Grief Memorial Gift","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ouByAoWBS._AC_SL1250_.jpg","description":"This stunning Lola Bella Gifts and Burton and Burton Cardinal Ornament and Red Feathered Soul Poem Card will make the perfect gift for those missing someone who has passed away, but still living in their hearts. The stunning snow frosted cardinal ornament is made from hand blown glass and is carefully hand painted with decals. The beautiful cardinals are sitting on a tree branch that has red glitters for berries. The detail is just stunning. The ornament measures 4\" in height x 4\" wide x 4\" in diameter. The ornament measures 9\" in total height with hanger. It is truly a great way to remember a precious soul that has touched your life. Also included is the \"Red Feathered Soul\" poem written by Elle Bee with the soulful message from loved ones passed on that they are forever with us. They come inside our very own Red Feathered Soul box with the message that love never dies. Inside, the ornament is wrapped in a beautiful Cardinal on a branch themed tissue paper. It is truly a stunning gift presentation that makes the perfect memorial gift, as well as a touching and special gift for other holidays, like Christmas, birthdays, and Mother's Day. It's the perfect sympathy gift, grief gift, bereavement gift, or to comfort someone who is missing someone.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ouByAoWBS._AC_SL1250_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lola Bella Gifts","source_asin":"B07TQK7HX6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-837907","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07TQK7HX6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07TQK7HX6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":837908,"name":"South Shore Spark Full Storage Bed and Bookcase Headboard, Pure Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ti31ZB3uL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"With its Pure Black finish and sleek contemporary lines, this sturdy full storage bed and bookcase headboard will enhance any bedroom. Its Satin Zinc flat metal handles accentuate the modern design of the bed while making opening and closing the drawers a breeze. It is a great storage solution as the headboard features 3 storage spaces for alarm clock, books, charging station, etc. and a hole at the back for easy wire management. As for the bed, you will enjoy its 4 drawers (2 on each side) to stock extra clothes, toys, pillows, blankets and more. It is also an economical choice as it does not require a box spring. It can support up to 500 pounds. The interior drawer dimensions are 22.5\" wide by 17.75\" front to back by 4.25\" height and are equipped with safe and silent plastic slides. It measures 86\" long by 56\" wide by 37\" high. Mattress and accessories not included. Safety is an integrated part of our values: this product meets or exceeds all North American safety standards. Requires complete assembly by 2 adults (tools not included). This item ships in 3 boxes, so be sure to have a friend with you - or good biceps! - when it arrives. Dimensions Box No.1: 84\" (L) x 20.75\" (D) x 3.5\" (H), 132 lbs. Dimensions Box No.2: 63.5\" (L) x 14.75\" (D) x 6\" (H), 105 lbs. Dimensions Box No.3: 60.5\" (L) x 12.75\" (D) x 4\" (H), 47 lbs. This product's packaging has been tested and is certified to reduce the risk of damage during shipment. Made in Canada with non-toxic laminated particleboard. Clean with a dry damp cloth. 5-year limited warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ti31ZB3uL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"South Shore","source_asin":"B00KXWU0M8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-837908","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00KXWU0M8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00KXWU0M8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
