window.products.push({"id":837947,"name":"JEASOM Cast Iron Griddle for Weber 6558 Q100 Q120 Q1000 Q1200; Q100 Q1000 Series Grills (12.6\" x 8.6\"x 0.5\")","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NVlHL9jYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Fit for Weber Q100 Q120 Q1000 Q1200 Series 52020001 50060001 51060001 50060301 51249998 51089999 51249999 51249997 51229999 51229903 51169999 Dimensions- High quality cast-iron dimensions: 12.6 x 8.6 x 0.5 inches (a half size of grill). 【Package】- Including 1 Griddle. Notice: Fit fine with 1 griddle and 1 grate. Do not fit 2 griddle in the same grill SUPERIOR QUALITY - Made of heavy matte cast iron to ensure long-lasting use, which can distribute heat evenly across entire surface. It also has better bearing capacity EASY TO CLEAN -Do not leave standing water in cast iron cooking grate for longer than 10-15 minutes. Wipe off excess oil and food residue with a paper towel or cloth. If you decide to clean with soap and water, always dry the grate immediately with a towel to evaporate any remianing mositure before stored EASY TO MAINTAIN -Leave a coating of cooking oil on the cast iron grill grate after each use. We recommend the use of saturated fats because they are more stable at room temperature and less susceptible to oxidation. If you use the cast iron grill every day, it doesn't matter what kind of oil you use. If not used for a long time, it should be treated with saturated fat oil such as coconut oil, lard or butter","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NVlHL9jYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JEASOM","source_asin":"B082FW5FYV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-837947","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082FW5FYV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B082FW5FYV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":837948,"name":"Coop Home Goods Premium Full Mattress Protector Ultra Soft Breathable Bed Cover - Waterproof Mattress Cover - Noiseless & Absorbent Topper - Oeko-TEX ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":56.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cR64-B3aL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"IS YOUR MATTRESS REALLY PROTECTED? – Say goodbye to mysterious stains. With a top layer of waterproof protection and breathable sides, our Mattress Cover gives an extra layer of protection against sweat, drool, bodily fluids and spills. IS YOUR MATTRESS PROTECTOR OEKO-TEX CERTIFIED? – We know this one is! This means that the Mattress Pad Protector is 100% safe for you and your loved ones! Available sizes: Twin, Twin XL, Full, Queen, King, California King GIVE YOURSELF THE SILENT TREATMENT – No need for other Mattress Protectors that crinkle with every movement. Coop Mattress Protector is created with our unique Lulltra Fabric. It is breathable, soft, and silent so you can sleep in peace and comfort. ADD YEARS TO YOUR MATTRES’S LIFESPAN - You spent a small fortune on your mattress. Add years to its lifespan with our Mattress Protector! It fits mattresses up to 18” deep. Washable and reusable, designed to keep your mattress safe. LOVE IT OR RETURN IT! - You can purchase with confidence. If you dont fall in love within 100 nights (although we’re sure you will), contact us to return the Mattress Protector for a refund. Our Coop Mattress Protectors come with a 5-year warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cR64-B3aL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Coop Home Goods","source_asin":"B0896599VP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-837948","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0896599VP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0896599VP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":837949,"name":"Raynic Alarm Clock, 8.7 Inch Digital Clock,5 Adjustable Volume Calendar Clock with Type-C Charger,Dual Alarms,Temperature, Humidity,Date,and 5 Dimmer ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sT6b6+mpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Compact Desk Clock Easy to Use: This clock for bedroom is easy to set, even the elderly and kids can set it up themselves without any issues. With a Type-C and USB charging port, DST and 12/24 hours formats switchable, and 9 min snooze funciton, this alarm clock with a modern wooden look only takes up a little space of bedside table, which is the ideal alarm clock for bedrooms, living rooms, and offices. Dual Alarms with 4 Mode Options: Customizable alarm settings of the digital clock meet the wake-up needs of each individual and different family members. You can set 2 separate alarms in 4 modes of Weekdays, Weekdends, Everyday and One Time to wake up different family members, or you can get a second reminder that it's time to go to work or school. 8.7\" Digital Clock with Temperature and Humidity: The date clock with large LED numbers, even the elderly and visually impaired can read easily. Providing accurate dates and times helps avoid missing any important meetings and anniversaries. This clock also can keep track the most accurate indoor temperature and humidity, and allow you to know the time, temperature and humidity of the day with just a glance. Adjustable Brightness and Volume: The day clock has 5 levels of adjustable brightness, you can dim the display to your liking. This digital alarm clock is perfect for those who are sensitive to light, helping them to have sweet dreams all night long. Also with 5 levels of volume options, the volume of the alarm clock can be set from 0-120 dB. With the gradual ringing tone, this bedside clock can not only gently wake up the elderly and children, but also loud enough for heavy sleepers! Support Type-C and USB Charging: Raynic digital calendar clock provides Type-C and USB charging ports, which can be compatible to charge more electronic devices, help you conveniently charge your phone or other devices simultaneously while sleeping and help reduce the number of outlets used within your bedroom significantly, making it a neater environment. Please note that this is a Non-battery-powered Clock, 2 AAA batteries (not included) are only used to remember time and alarm settings when power outage. Raynic modern wood alarm clocks feature a natural wood grain, each with a unique surface texture. It would be an ideal birthday, Christmas, New Year gift for those who are looking for unique decor for their bedroom, living room, or office.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sT6b6+mpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Raynic","source_asin":"B0B76JKN5B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-837949","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B76JKN5B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B76JKN5B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
